    "created_at": "2026-11-22T11:20:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T11:20:24Z",
    "body": "fix on issue/3356-face-pass-start · PR #3387 · pinned by face_pass_start::mcp_refuses_pass_start_on_face_by_the_row_order, egui_app::tests::pass_start::the_face_passes_tab_says_it_has_no_pass_order · merges when reviewed\n\nThe PR is stacked on #3353. Face has no pass order: its rows run edge to edge, so there is no inside or outside to start from. The Face row shows this by name and MCP refuses `pass_start` on a Face with the same reason. The decision is in `docs/decisions/3356-face-pass-start.md`. No golden changes.\n",
